le now we talked  about that a few months ago  what's your reaction to the successes we  saw in november  i'm absolutely thrilled i mean i was  shocked when i  saw the statistics saying that out of  the 11 000 people  who have ever served in the united  states congress only 359  have ever been women that's three  percent 21 of our states have  never been represented by a woman in the  senate and so  it's time to change that it's time to  step up and do something about it and  that's exactly what these women are  doing  they it's it's not just women on the  left that have these amazing stories i  cannot wait for america  to share the stories of the trail  blazing women that we're  now going to have in congress  um and nancy what just tell us some of  the sort of issues that you particularly  want to be focusing on and fighting for  once you're once you're up there in in  congress yourself  right well we can see right now with  covet 19 that is on hearts and minds of  families everywhere  especially people who've lost their jobs  lost their businesses lost  their livelihoods south carolina as a  whole we've done a really good job of  balancing  keeping people safe and healthy with  getting back to work and our  unemployment rate hovers just over just  north of four percent right now but  there are many states that aren't taking  those similar  or same actions and their economies are  crumbling so  getting us through this pandemic is is  job number one  but also ensuring that you know as we  look at this and spending in the future  we haven't been holding each other  accountable and so i think you really  have to look at our budget look at  fiscal policy  look at the the rise in the national  debt and the annual the deficit that we  have every year  it's untenable and we've got to make  smart decisions in the future  with targeted reliefs really focusing on  those that need it most  and and getting our folks back to work  safely that's  extremely important as a state lawmaker  i'm known as being fiscally conservative  but also  i'm known for reaching across the aisle  i had a prison reform bill  signed into law in south carolina in the  middle of covid so  i would like to continue working on some  of these issues where i can find  some solidarity with members of the  democratic party and work on  environmental issues work on some social  issues prison reform criminal justice  reform things that we can agree on  and help our country move forward and  heal  that's so great i mean again you know  not just by being there but the way  you're talking about your role  just shattering these these kind of  false caricatures that are made against  republicans  um briefly what can we if someone's  watching  um and thinking yeah i want to run for  offers but you know i'm just nervous  about it you know there's so many  barriers in the way  um what are some of the practical what's  some of the practical advice you'd have  for  for women on the right who want to run  for office  the one thing that i want women to know  is that they just need to take action  they just need to believe in themselves  we need your leadership and if you don't  do it  who will if we care about the future of  this country if we care about protecting  the freedom that makes america so  exceptional  we have to have the right spokes people  to deliver that message we have to have  the right role models  for our young women to look up to so  this isn't about  you know vote for a woman just because  she's a woman it's about we have  outstanding women across this country  and those those stories are being told  in a relatable way  so now you have a foil to the aocs of  the world who  who can say you know i went to from  waffle house to the u.s  house and and they're the ones that are  going to have the policies  that are going to bring our next  generation of women  up and it's so it's believe in yourself  and even if it's scary even if it's  risky  just do it exactly like nancy mays did  and  and she's there and we're very very  excited to see it thank you both so much  for joining us see you soon
 

